WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:03.339
- Hey friend, why don't you join us?

00:00:03.339 --> 00:00:04.845
Why don't you come back?

00:00:04.845 --> 00:00:05.979
Thank you, oh okay.

00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:07.778
Oh okay, goodbye.

00:00:07.778 --> 00:00:10.361
(upbeat music)

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.693
I had a very interesting time
starring on a reality show

00:00:23.693 --> 00:00:25.606
at only the age of eight.

00:00:25.606 --> 00:00:29.773
Oh, oh, but I don't think I
would ever do one ever again

00:00:31.329 --> 00:00:33.581
just because they're a little stressful

00:00:33.581 --> 00:00:35.664
and I'd rather do acting.

00:00:39.603 --> 00:00:43.751
I think a transition from
dancing to acting is different

00:00:43.751 --> 00:00:45.656
and the same in so many ways,

00:00:45.656 --> 00:00:47.636
because when you dance you have to act

00:00:47.636 --> 00:00:49.102
and you have to show emotion,

00:00:49.102 --> 00:00:53.102
so I think it really
helped me relate to acting.

00:00:55.992 --> 00:00:59.341
It's pretty obvious, I have
the biggest crush on Zac Efron.

00:00:59.341 --> 00:01:01.127
I've had it since I was five-years-old.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:03.016
I will always love him till the day I die.

00:01:03.016 --> 00:01:07.183
I wish I could marry him, but
he's slightly too old for me.

00:01:10.121 --> 00:01:14.288
I would say Zendaya is a
really big inspiration for me

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:19.792
in the fashion world just
because she has so many

00:01:19.792 --> 00:01:21.759
amazing looks and it's
different every time.

00:01:21.759 --> 00:01:24.697
Sometimes she decides to go
more on the tomboy route,

00:01:24.697 --> 00:01:26.471
or sometimes she decides to make it

00:01:26.471 --> 00:01:27.886
super girly and glamorous,

00:01:27.886 --> 00:01:31.969
so she's definitely a very
big inspiration to me.

00:01:37.685 --> 00:01:39.730
I had no clue that
Chandelier would blow up,

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:42.345
let alone have over a billion views,

00:01:42.345 --> 00:01:46.363
and it was probably the best
experience and day of my life

00:01:46.363 --> 00:01:47.990
when that video released,

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:49.990
just because ever since then

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:52.823
it's just been a whirlwind for me.

00:01:57.015 --> 00:01:59.094
To make sure I love
everything that I'm doing,

00:01:59.094 --> 00:02:01.535
and to always remember
that I'm still a child,

00:02:01.535 --> 00:02:04.368
and to never take anything too far

00:02:05.318 --> 00:02:07.568
so that I'm not overworked.

00:02:12.649 --> 00:02:16.566
She plays really old
music and she'll dress up,

00:02:17.785 --> 00:02:20.775
and she'll impersonate all
of my dances that I did

00:02:20.775 --> 00:02:22.310
when I used to compete.

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:23.864
She was the biggest fan of Dance Moms

00:02:23.864 --> 00:02:26.464
and she knows more of it than I do,

00:02:26.464 --> 00:02:28.881
so it's really, really funny.

00:02:32.035 --> 00:02:33.210
Less is more.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:36.214
When you're wearing too much makeup,

00:02:36.214 --> 00:02:38.797
I feel like you can look cakey.

00:02:43.471 --> 00:02:45.020
Oh it's okay, you can eat my hair,

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.579
I don't really mind.

00:02:46.579 --> 00:02:49.552
I don't know exactly what
I'll be doing in 20 years.

00:02:49.552 --> 00:02:53.705
I think I would love to
continue acting and dancing.

00:02:53.705 --> 00:02:55.781
Maybe choreograph some things,

00:02:55.781 --> 00:02:57.997
do a lot more music videos with Sia,

00:02:57.997 --> 00:03:01.664
and continue to feature
in a bunch of films.

00:03:08.579 --> 00:03:10.008
Hey, a dog toy.

00:03:10.008 --> 00:03:13.508
Oh, that one just slipped through my legs.

00:03:14.597 --> 00:03:15.430
Okay.

00:03:17.837 --> 00:03:20.340
You're so adorable, can you say bye?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.173
Bye.

